---
// An illustration of the Wordy window drawn in HTML so the landing page needs no
// screenshot. Replace with <img src="/screenshot.png"> once there is a clean one.
---

<figure
  class="win"
  aria-label="Illustration of the Wordy window: sidebar with the manuscript tree, the prose editor in the middle, and the reference pane on the right"
>
  <div class="title">
    <span class="dots">
      <i></i>
      <i></i>
      <i></i>
    </span>
    <span>Wordy — The Lighthouse</span>
    <span class="spacer"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <aside class="rail">
      <span class="on">M</span>
      <span>W</span>
      <span>N</span>
    </aside>
    <aside class="tree">
      <div class="h">Manuscript</div>
      <div class="row act">Part One</div>
      <div class="row ch">1 · The Keeper</div>
      <div class="row sc on">Night watch</div>
      <div class="row sc">Ships she could not see</div>
      <div class="row ch">2 · Landfall</div>
      <div class="row sc">The rowboat</div>
      <div class="row sc">Mara at the quay</div>
      <div class="row act">Part Two</div>
      <div class="row ch">3 · Weather</div>
    </aside>
    <section class="editor">
      <div class="tabs">
        <span class="on">Night watch</span>
        <span>Mara</span>
        <span>Home</span>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          It was a dark and stormy night, and <a>the keeper</a> had not slept in
          three days. The lamp turned, and turned, and the sea came up the rocks
          like something hungry.
        </p>
        <p>
          She counted the ships she could not see. Seven, by the bells.{" "}
          <mark>Mara</mark> would be on the fourth, if the letter was true.
        </p>
        <p>
          The letter was not true.<span class="caret"></span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="status">
        <span>saved just now</span>
        <span>412 words · today +188 · streak 6</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <aside class="ref">
      <div class="h">Reference</div>
      <div class="name">Mara</div>
      <div class="meta">Character · appears in 4 scenes</div>
      <p>
        Sister of the keeper. Left for the mainland the spring the lamp failed.
      </p>
      <div class="meta">Aliases: Mar, the sister</div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .win {
    --w-bg: #fbf8f1;
    --w-side: #f1ece0;
    --w-line: #ded5c2;
    --w-text: #2a2930;
    --w-dim: #8a8373;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--w-bg);
    color: var(--w-text);
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 60px -30px rgba(30, 29, 36, 0.45),
      0 2px 6px rgba(30, 29, 36, 0.08);
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    user-select: none;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .win {
      --w-bg: #26252d;
      --w-side: #1f1e25;
      --w-line: #3a3943;
      --w-text: #ebe4d6;
      --w-dim: #9a9382;
    }
  }
  .title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--w-line);
    background: var(--w-side);
    color: var(--w-dim);
  }
  .dots i {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--w-line);
    margin-right: 5px;
  }
  .spacer {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem 9.5rem 1fr 9.5rem;
    min-height: 22rem;
  }
  .rail {
    background: var(--w-side);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--w-line);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--w-dim);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .rail .on {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .tree,
  .ref {
    background: var(--w-side);
    padding: 0.7rem 0.6rem;
  }
  .tree {
    border-right: 1px solid var(--w-line);
  }
  .ref {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--w-line);
  }
  .h {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--w-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .row {
    padding: 0.18rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .row.act {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }
  .row.ch {
    padding-left: 0.9rem;
  }
  .row.sc {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--w-dim);
  }
  .row.on {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 14%, transparent);
    color: var(--w-text);
  }
  .editor {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--w-line);
  }
  .tabs span {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    color: var(--w-dim);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--w-line);
  }
  .tabs .on {
    color: var(--w-text);
    background: var(--w-bg);
    box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 var(--accent);
  }
  .prose {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    max-width: 30rem;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .prose p {
    margin: 0 0 0.6em;
  }
  .prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline dotted;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
  .prose mark {
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--accent);
  }
  .caret {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1em;
    background: var(--w-text);
    vertical-align: -0.15em;
    margin-left: 1px;
    animation: blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes blink {
    50% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  .status {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
    gap: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--w-line);
    color: var(--w-dim);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ref .name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ref .meta {
    color: var(--w-dim);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .ref p {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .body {
      grid-template-columns: 2rem 9rem 1fr;
    }
    .ref {
      display: none;
    }
    .prose {
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: 0;
    }
    .rail,
    .tree {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .caret {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
